       ],
       "text": "http://article.gmane.org/gmane.comp.cms.fedora-commons.devel/1001",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Running the analyzer when upgrading from 2.x to 3.1 causes a ClassNotFoundException due to missing classes in the distribution.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Until this is fixed, a workaround is described here:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
