  "description": "<p>As reported here: <a href=\"http://article.gmane.org/gmane.comp.cms.fedora-commons.devel/1001\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://article.gmane.org/gmane.comp.cms.fedora-commons.devel/1001</a></p>\n\n<p>Running the analyzer when upgrading from 2.x to 3.1 causes a ClassNotFoundException due to missing classes in the distribution.</p>\n\n<p>Until this is fixed, a workaround is described here:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://wiki.dlib.indiana.edu/confluence/display/INF/Test+Server+Migration+Notes\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://wiki.dlib.indiana.edu/confluence/display/INF/Test+Server+Migration+Notes</a></p>",
